2. What you may not do without the author's prior written consent

   a. Sell, rent, lease, lend or sublicense the Software, or charge any fee for it or for access to it.
   b. Redistribute the Software or any part of it, for a fee or for free: no re-uploading, mirroring or hosting it
      elsewhere, and no including it in other software, bundles, installers, collections, stores or devices.
   c. Modify, translate, adapt, or create derivative works of the Software.
   d. Reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble the Software, except to the extent that applicable law expressly
      allows it despite this restriction.
   e. Remove or change any copyright notice, license text or attribution in the Software.
   f. Use the name "Mic Studio", its logo or the author's name to suggest that the author endorses you or your
      product.

   To ask for consent, open an issue at https://github.com/xxWismaxx/MicStudio-releases/issues or write to
